00:08:54.744 --> 00:08:58.775
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:08:59.375 --> 00:09:07.895
<v Slow>18日、長期金利は一時、何パーセントまで上がりましたか。

00:09:08.696 --> 00:09:13.567
<v Host>Two point nine four five percent — the highest in about thirty years.

00:09:14.168 --> 00:09:19.855
