00:09:34.008 --> 00:09:38.375
<v Host>Fixed-rate mortgages, and the rates companies pay to borrow money.

00:09:38.975 --> 00:09:51.816
<v Host>That's all for today. Interest rates touch everything from home loans to savings accounts, so this thirty-year milestone matters for everyday life in Japan. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

